Plane** | Retain validation results, routing decisions, policy flags, and reference resolution
status for auditing. |\n| **Acknowledge Trade-offs** | Introduces engineering overhead, latency, and
reduced improvisation. Justified for enterprise, regulated, or tool-access systems; avoid for low-
stakes prototypes. |\n\n## Conclusion\nThe next wave of agent and service design is not about
